:: Dramatis_Personae [codex] {"position":"260,240","size":"100,100"}
## 👥 Dramatis Personae (Cast of Characters)

### Elena Cross *(protagonist)*
Former Spire cipher analyst whose memory was selectively erased after stumbling upon Council corruption.

### Julian Sterling *(antagonist)*
Architect of the city's memory-scrubbing registry who rose to Councilman through orchestrated amnesia.

### Orin Vance *(ally)*
Black-market data slicer operating out of the drainage conduits.

### Orin Vance *(Black-market data slicer)*

