:: World_Codex [codex] {"position":"420,240","size":"100,100"}
## 🗺️ World Codex & Setting

### Locations
* **Lower Conduit District**: Perpetually rain-soaked neon corridor riddled with counterfeit cybernetics shops and steam drainage valves.
* **The Sunken Bazaar**: Flooded subterranean concourse operating under black-market frequency dampeners.
* **Spire Peak Archives**: Pristine, temperature-controlled monolithic towers overseeing the smog canopy.

### Factions & Organizations
